1. WHAT THIS COVERS

This licence covers the source code, configuration and documentation in this
repository ("the Software").

It does not cover the NFLMeta database or any data served by nflmeta.org. Those
are addressed in section 4.

It also does not cover the client libraries under sdk/. Those are released under
the MIT licence, set out in sdk/LICENSE, which takes precedence for everything in
that directory. A client library exists to be installed and used inside someone
else's project, so withholding that permission would defeat its purpose.
Permissive licensing costs nothing here: the SDK is a thin wrapper over the
public API, and access to the data remains governed entirely by section 4 and the
API terms.


