4. THE DATA IS NOT LICENSED HERE

The NFLMeta database is a compiled work. The individual facts within it are not
owned by anyone, but the selection, verification, correction, reconciliation
and arrangement of those facts represents substantial independent effort and is
claimed as a protected compilation to the extent the law allows.

Nothing in this licence grants any right to that database. Access to the data
is governed solely by the API terms at https://nflmeta.org/terms and the plan
purchased.

In particular, publishing this repository does not permit:

  (a) bulk or systematic extraction of the data through the API or any other
      means, whether or not it stays within plan limits;
  (b) redistribution or resale of the data, in whole or in substantial part,
      in any form;
  (c) using the data to build, train or populate a competing dataset,
      database or service.


